1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,190
I have used the Halden desk lamp

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:04,340
for thirty days

3
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:06,480
It costs forty-nine pounds

4
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,020
which is not cheap

5
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:10,560
The arm folds flat

6
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,850
so it fits on a narrow shelf

7
00:00:13,450 --> 00:00:15,370
You get fine brightness levels

8
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:16,910
and three colour modes

9
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:20,590
I really like the warm mode at night

10
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:23,280
it is so easy on the eyes

11
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:26,190
It charges by cable and lasts

12
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,340
about eight hours

13
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,480
The base is heavy

14
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:30,380
so it does tip over

15
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:35,080
My one complaint is the touch button

16
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:36,620
which is too sensitive

17
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:40,680
Do buy it if you need a lamp

18
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,220
for a big desk

19
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:45,510
Should I review the cheaper one next
